Article 10 (Duties and Authority of Senior Military Attaches)
A senior military attache shall perform the duties prescribed in Article 8 and, pursuant to Article 6 (1) of the Decree, direct and supervise other stationed military attaches concerning the following matters: <Amended on December 3, 2012; and July 4, 2018.>
1. Performance by other stationed military attaches of the duties prescribed in Article 8;
2. Management and operation of the property of the Military Attache Office at a Diplomatic Mission Abroad;
3. Handling general affairs of the Military Attache Office at a Diplomatic Mission Abroad;
4. Budget and accounting matters of the Military Attache Office at a Diplomatic Mission Abroad.
